{
  "$comment": "The bar along the window's top, over the tree, the pictures and the sidebar, in every view.",
  "params": {
    "bar": "Bar"
  },
  "nodes": {
    "component": "NavBar",
    "border": "color.border",
    "leading": [
      {
        "id": "back",
        "component": "BarIcon",
        "icon": "arrow_back",
        "on": {
          "tap": {
            "back": true
          }
        },
        "dim": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "if": "bar.canBack",
              "then": false
            },
            {
              "else": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "forward",
        "component": "BarIcon",
        "icon": "arrow_forward",
        "only": "regular",
        "dim": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "if": "bar.canForward",
              "then": false
            },
            {
              "else": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "crumbs",
        "component": "Text",
        "text": "{bar.crumbs}",
        "font": "font.subhead",
        "maxLines": 1
      }
    ],
    "trailing": [
      {
        "id": "mode",
        "component": "Row",
        "gap": 0,
        "only": "regular",
        "assumed": "用一个「检查 / 试玩」切换代替只能靠按住 ⌘ 点击来试玩：试玩模式下普通点击就走原型；也可以保持现在的 ⌘-click，不加切换。",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "inspect",
            "component": "Segment",
            "text": "Inspect",
            "on": {
              "tap": {
                "set": "bar.mode",
                "to": "inspect"
              }
            },
            "selected": {
              "cases": [
                {
                  "if": "bar.inspecting",
                  "then": true
                },
                {
                  "else": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "play",
            "component": "Segment",
            "text": "Play",
            "on": {
              "tap": {
                "set": "bar.mode",
                "to": "play"
              }
            },
            "selected": {
              "cases": [
                {
                  "if": "bar.playing",
                  "then": true
                },
                {
                  "else": false
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "padding": 2,
        "radius": 999,
        "border": "color.border"
      },
      {
        "id": "agent",
        "component": "AgentStatus",
        "only": "regular",
        "assumed": "工具栏常驻显示有没有 agent 在用 notes --wait 听这个目录，没人听时人一眼就知道写的笔记暂时没人处理；也可以只在发出笔记之后才在对话里说。",
        "listening": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "if": "bar.listening",
              "then": true
            },
            {
              "else": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "inbox",
        "component": "Row",
        "if": "bar.owed",
        "on": {
          "tap": {
            "toggle": "bar.inboxOpen"
          }
        },
        "assumed": "「等你处理」的数量常驻在工具栏，点一下就在侧栏列出来，不管当前选中了什么；也可以像现在一样只在什么都没选中时才在侧栏里出现。",
        "gap": 0,
        "padding": 2,
        "radius": 999,
        "border": "color.border",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "inbox-count",
            "component": "Segment",
            "text": "{bar.waitingOnYou} waiting on you",
            "selected": {
              "cases": [
                {
                  "if": "bar.inboxOpen",
                  "then": true
                },
                {
                  "else": false
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sidebar",
        "component": "BarIcon",
        "only": "regular",
        "icon": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "if": "bar.sidebarShown",
              "then": "right_panel_close"
            },
            {
              "else": "right_panel_open"
            }
          ]
        },
        "on": {
          "tap": {
            "toggle": "bar.sidebar"
          }
        },
        "dim": false
      }
    ],
    "gap": 8
  },
  "fixtures": {
    "inspecting": {
      "bar": {
        "back": true,
        "crumbs": "drafts › shop › order › open",
        "agent": "listening",
        "waitingOnYou": 3
      }
    },
    "playing": {
      "bar": {
        "forward": true,
        "crumbs": "drafts › shop › order › cancel-dialog",
        "mode": "play",
        "agent": "away",
        "waitingOnYou": 0,
        "sidebar": false
      }
    },
    "inbox-open": {
      "$patch": "inspecting",
      "bar": {
        "inboxOpen": true
      }
    }
  }
}
